{
  "id": "SEC-OLD-05",
  "bp_entry": "BP-STOCK-32",
  "title": "Old address: one client id posts once, changed data under the same id is 409, malformed writes are refused and write nothing",
  "description": "SECURITY (decision 0091 section 9 'Retry by client id' with the T-2282 amendment and section 8; REQ-860, REQ-909). Every operation id is a fresh UUID of the run (${uuid1}..${uuid5}, made by the runner), the same on a retry. With a valid shared value the phone posts a receipt of 1 unit at the first balance key of the old address: 201, the balance rises by 1. The same id and data again: 200 with the stored row, the same movement id, the balance is not doubled. The same id with another quantity: 409 'this operation was already posted with different data'. Malformed writes are refused 400 with the old server's texts and write nothing: no id, an id that is not a UUID, no operator, an operator over 200 characters, quantity 0, a negative quantity, a quantity that is not a number, an unknown kind, a body that is a JSON list, a body over 8192 bytes (413 'body too large'), an unknown item number (404 'unknown sku'). Reversal: a new id reverses the movement (201), the same id again answers the stored reversal (200), another id on the same movement is 400 'already reversed', a reversal of the reversal is 400 'a reversal cannot be reversed; post a new operation instead', the post's own id used for a reversal is 409, and an unknown movement is 404 'unknown movement'. The balance ends where it began. Cleanup reverses the receipt if the run stopped before the reversal, then revokes the value. Precondition: no other walk posts at the same item and place during the run (the checks compare only what this run did).",
  "tenant": "${tenant}",
  "inputs": [],
  "dry_run": {
    "tenant": "qoimeks-qa2",
    "actors": {
      "admin": "qoimeks-qa2-admin"
    },
    "inputs": {},
    "old_base_url": "https://qa.bizdala.com/qoimeks/qoimeks-qa2"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "actor": "admin",
      "do": {
        "api": "GET",
        "path": "/api/v1/identity/shared-stock-access"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 200,
        "json": {
          "$.enabled": true,
          "$.exists": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "actor": "admin",
      "do": {
        "api": "POST",
        "path": "/api/v1/identity/shared-stock-access",
        "body": {}
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 201
      },
      "save": {
        "shared_created": "yes",
        "shared_access": {
          "secret": "$.value"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "http_as": "shared_access",
      "do": {
        "api": "GET",
        "path": "/api/balances"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 200,
        "json": {
          "$[0].sku_id": {
            "exists": true
          }
        }
      },
      "save": {
        "sku_id": "$[0].sku_id",
        "location_id": "$[0].location_id"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "http_as": "shared_access",
      "do": {
        "api": "GET",
        "path": "/api/balances?sku_id=${sku_id}&location_id=${location_id}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 200
      },
      "save": {
        "b0": {
          "pick": "$[0].qty",
          "default": "0"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "http_as": "shared_access",
      "do": {
        "api": "POST",
        "path": "/api/movements",
        "body": {
          "kind": "receipt",
          "sku_id": "${sku_id}",
          "location_id": "${location_id}",
          "qty": 1,
          "operator": "UAT ${run_id}",
          "id": "${uuid1}"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 201,
        "json": {
          "$.kind": "receipt",
          "$.qty": 1,
          "$.sku_id": "${sku_id}",
          "$.location_id": "${location_id}"
        }
